# Trivy Vulnerability Suppressions for Bookdrop Production Image

# CVE-2023-45853: Integer overflow in MiniZip (contrib/minizip) in zlib through 1.3.
# Upstream Debian 12 security status is 'will_not_fix'. Debian's zlib1g package is built without the contrib MiniZip library,
# meaning the vulnerable MiniZip code is not compiled into the binary or exposed to the application.
CVE-2023-45853
